  "the-house-on-the-borderland": `An Irish house at the edge of a pit, and a manuscript that goes too far. Sit with the world a moment before the first breath.`,
  "the-hungry-stones-and-other-stories": `The Hungry Stones and Other Stories (1916): devotion as quiet attention, without a sermon. Enter one room at a time.`,
