  "the-innocence-of-father-brown": `A small priest sees the crime because he knows the sinner from the inside. Enter one room at a time.`,
  "the-immoralist": `Faithful friends summoned to a distant house — Michel can free himself; he cannot yet say what freedom is for. This tbr cut stops on the freedom line.`,
  "the-iron-heel": `London’s oligarchy of the future, told as a warning already coming true. Sit with the world a moment before the first breath.`,
