  "the-purple-cloud": `M. P. Shiel’s 1901 novel The Purple Cloud. Sit with the world a moment before the first breath.`,
  "the-purple-land": `“Three chapters in the story of my life…” opens the frame into the Banda Oriental. Skip the 1904 preface. Hudson’s 1885 novel. Uruguay, not Guyana. Guerrilla and gaucho country.`,
